{
  "_comment": "Shared supersession cases (t/4356, TL t/4356#7; t/4877 adds situation + cross-kind cases, mirrors t/4872): lib/debate/supersession.fixture.test.ts runs them through TS buildSupersessionIndex and tests/TaxonomySupersession.Tests.ps1 through PS New-TaxonomySupersessionIndex, so the two can't drift. nodes are POV and/or situation nodes in file order (bare ids like \"a\"/\"b\" have no recognized kind prefix and are never cross-kind against each other or against real acc-/sit- ids); selectable = nodes without a non-empty superseded_by; resolve maps id -> resolved id (null = unknown id); warn_kinds is the set of warning kinds emitted (chain, cycle, dangling, cross_kind).",
